WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.920
His wife.

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:02.020
What?

3
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:03.860
His wife.

4
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.380
So shoot her and bring him to me.

5
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.440
Er, Tommy, Mrs. Cangretta was a teacher at our school.

6
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.680
She's a good woman, Tom.

7
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.220
Good woman.

8
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.480
Well, if she's a good woman, then she'll go to heaven.

9
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.060
Eh, Arthur?

